                        of Decisions</hi>, pp. 303–304; <hi rendition="#italic">
                        Stalin’s Correspondence</hi>, vol.
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 245. Cf. Churchill, <hi rendition="#italic">Triumph and
                        Tragedy</hi>, pp. 603–606. See also <ref target="#d75-f2">document No. 75,
                        footnote 2</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
